{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_title", "source_sha256": "42058b8739396b035f597d2dcc7af0504084c33411c36c0c8c4c01975d9fdc08", "ja": "どうせ恋をするのなら", "zh": "既然要谈恋爱的话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_synopsis", "source_sha256": "952293d1ef022b21e1970ab9c3970faf65c248841de245cf7416e0abd4faf791", "ja": "アイドルの恋について、否定的な朋花。公演\nメンバーからアドバイスを受けた結果、プロ\nデューサーの個人情報を聞き出し、デートを\nする事に。そこで聞かされた言葉に、朋花は\nアイドルである事への決意を新たにする。", "zh": "朋花对偶像恋爱持否定态度。在听取公演\n成员的建议后，她打听出了制作人的\n个人信息，并决定前去约会。而制作人在约会中所说的\n那番话，让朋花更加坚定了身为偶像的决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1000_p", "source_sha256": "002827bbea1f556e6b154ec1da28d4c7df8c2ad95935de415cc073dd8fb6acbd", "ja": "（朋花の新曲お披露目公演は大成功！\n終演後、朋花に呼び出され、屋上へやって来た……）", "zh": "（朋花的新歌亮相公演大获成功！演出结束后，朋花把我叫到了屋顶上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "17f154a81d1400a0c4784f293820bbdd63220fd03509f43e94bd6eb79cf92af2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n辛苦了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c25ad79520ba70565dbc58ec30a60a2c9e85a83bde5a6528ef066f51d4c21ef2", "ja": "お疲れさま、朋花。どうしたんだ？\nこんなところに呼び出したりして……。", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花。怎么了？\n把我叫到这种地方来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "b25986b1c36057befbcf1a0482b9b267a459dbd97f8ca0dd2b96f8c57dafa68e", "ja": "ええ。\nすこし、ふたりきりで話したかったので。", "zh": "嗯，因为我想和你单独聊一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1004_p", "source_sha256": "68c0c8c5c16ec28f48d73a40b22da39caf0be109477d0b574d5622e056b0b0a3", "ja": "ふたりきりで……\nもしかして、デートの時の話か？", "zh": "只有我们两个人……\n难道是要说约会时的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "934f1cf5548373393dcf6fefc33d0b772df59517c4de5202d93a397c54b26c94", "ja": "はい。……あの時の{$P$}さんの\n言葉を、あれからずっと考えていたんです～。", "zh": "是的……我一直在思考那时{$P$}先生所说的话～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "3702ac843e5307a4589abe1610271dc5eb8a9e8417c95f980c95a620e2fd0d6f", "ja": "最初は、仮にも担当しているアイドルに向かって、\nこの人は何を言うのだろう、と思いましたが……。", "zh": "一开始，我心想，这个人居然对自己负责的偶像说出这种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "943b7c89f406a4cb9e4207d9d8171cc9b7dfde95d711b02b927198728f463158", "ja": "あなたは以前、私に、誓いをしましたよね～？", "zh": "您以前，不是向我立下过誓言吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "bed1c269228bedb75673287e57b8b550566e377e607583f34e3025ee379e983d", "ja": "あなたの身も心も、聖母のもの……。\n私の許しなく、無理をしない、と。", "zh": "你的身心都属于圣母……\n未经我的允许，绝不能勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1010_p", "source_sha256": "67b9a921e7a56ec7630b32423031146c3a8a1093a189e29c300148e1df40c042", "ja": "……？　ああ、そうだな。", "zh": "……？啊，是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "583a2b7112ede465145169649b621fb808ee90f1b04b3ba0146da177754e91cc", "ja": "そして私にも……ひとりですべてを\n背負わないよう、誓いを求めましたね～？", "zh": "还有我……你也要求我发誓，不要一个人承担一切，对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1012_p", "source_sha256": "593b2eb6d9dac095ff35f4a87177174e8558f15f9938e41d38e50386a84356e7", "ja": "うん。そうだ。", "zh": "嗯。是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "5daa81c6ea9cf01596dbbd623c6dba1bf33513208a8783d2032ebceaed5edc51", "ja": "ならば……私がもし恋をしたら、\nあなたはそれを、背負おうとするでしょう。", "zh": "那么……要是我爱上了谁，您也会想替我背负起那份感情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "14fa2ca74dd16028cdce72599bbc6e7f6f4573e3e4a80d9273e31792624faa5f", "ja": "ですが、あなたが背負おうとしているものは、\nきっと罪悪感だけではない……。", "zh": "但是，你想要背负的东西，肯定不只是罪恶感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "01923fe57ceaa80d343ef968f4ffcf03dcf19632a3038457bfb44aff66431f97", "ja": "そのことに気づいてしまった以上、\n私も、心を決めなければなりません～。", "zh": "既然我已经察觉到了这一点，我也必须下定决心了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "6550c41774823ac210377e82361a340251aed95bfcee0f2d0a713e12923b630a", "ja": "あなたが私に……天空橋朋花に、\nすべてを捧げると言うのなら……。", "zh": "既然您说要向我……向天空桥朋花，\n献上一切的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "4fd37a1bc0e142976bdf2efcd8a825d9968e59ef9f0c45efb516c45b6da9d074", "ja": "私もまた、アイドルという生き方に、\nすべてを捧げてみせましょう～。", "zh": "如果您说要将一切奉献给我……奉献给天空桥朋花的话……那我也会将一切奉献给偶像这条人生道路～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a2dcdaa0baaebe090bd54b06ddb43dc4f45f80846f44ef3f3f0e8ad9f354c167", "ja": "朋花……。", "zh": "朋花……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "602f1deeec6ec55218c5846609de8530cbde1a716b9df9fa15a969f5aee75ac7", "ja": "その代わり、生涯、私を支えることを\n命じますよ～？　いいですか～？", "zh": "作为交换，我命令您一生支持我哦～可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9fd0f8c2f6b29675170d42b13c077310d16ce8e46f29855162e36dab1a029088", "ja": "ああ……もちろんだ！", "zh": "啊……当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "15bb56eeaa4d26c67602b428eb3179140d5aa27ad77ec9ff8872ccf236352f51", "ja": "……。\n本当に、わかっているのかいないのか……。", "zh": "……。\n真是的，到底明不明白啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1023_p", "source_sha256": "edd75d42bad236064e1b53c77650a3da3afe19e724b0cd34b4e8084f7a12add6", "ja": "なんだ？", "zh": "什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_140_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_140_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "7aba60c6f6375b9f08f9f46027971679b25aec5a10a5c78528e721c84f0a0833", "ja": "いいえ、なんでもありません～。\nそろそろ、戻りましょうか～。", "zh": "不，没什么～。\n差不多该回去了吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
